            {
                "entry_id": "f1a738a4-a488-3121-9c2e-8bfe2db438c7",
                "word": "visitation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fcdd84e9-4564-4aa1-bc05-cd13ce3e3ee4",
                        "entry_id": "f1a738a4-a488-3121-9c2e-8bfe2db438c7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "visitations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a90d15ce-5b8c-3b5c-9aea-01756a21212f",
                        "entry_id": "f1a738a4-a488-3121-9c2e-8bfe2db438c7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de visiter ; visite."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bad98f64-f327-4902-8796-00aeab2271d2",
                                "sense_id": "a90d15ce-5b8c-3b5c-9aea-01756a21212f",
                                "text": "En fin de compte, comme le doute subsistait, on décida qu’il valait mieux se tromper dans la charité que dans la rigueur. On inscrivit donc aux registres, en face du nom de Daniel O’Donovan, les mots d’une vieille formule commode en pareil cas : mort par la visitation de Dieu, et l’on convint d’enterrer le jeune homme décemment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "496e8ccf-726b-4a2a-880a-0292465dac1e",
                                "sense_id": "a90d15ce-5b8c-3b5c-9aea-01756a21212f",
                                "text": "Où l'on cesse de parler de Dieu ou même à Dieu pour parler Dieu, c'est-à-dire où nos paroles traduisent cette Visitation mystérieuse de l’Esprit qui, avec nos vieux mots, dit la chaleur de notre cœur comme la détresse de notre âme abandonnée à sa solitude."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01b10143-63eb-4e50-9101-18c5060163b3",
                                "sense_id": "a90d15ce-5b8c-3b5c-9aea-01756a21212f",
                                "text": "Les hommes resteront le cœur saisi, les poumons douloureux, la bouche ouverte, émerveillés par ta visitation, petit ange, tes petits pieds, tes cheveux bouclés et ton regard d’enfant qui rendra même aux plus turbulents de ces nomades un peu de leur sainteté."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3793b03f-910c-408f-8693-c6f542aaf8f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1a738a4-a488-3121-9c2e-8bfe2db438c7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a90d15ce-5b8c-3b5c-9aea-01756a21212f",
                        "target_lang_word": "visitation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "visitation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e646c25-eeff-34d5-9083-1cbe94d51018",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of visiting, or an instance of being visited."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce2ea6e7-4443-4f49-a0bc-058ad9f8d74c",
                                                "sense_id": "1e646c25-eeff-34d5-9083-1cbe94d51018",
                                                "text": "Existing visitor facilities for both frontcountry areas experience crowding during the summer season, when the park receives most of its visitation, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ddbc3db-a859-4131-a940-43d2e8438537",
                                                "sense_id": "1e646c25-eeff-34d5-9083-1cbe94d51018",
                                                "text": "Such abundance must be laid out on superfluous recreations, buildings, ornaments, furniture, equipage, attendants, entertainments, visitations, braveries, and a world of need-nots […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e7a9eb7-fe0d-3c0a-a160-be1624eed506",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official visit to inspect or examine something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6db91ad7-d11a-32f1-96d7-7ba9a7afe883",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An encounter with aliens or supernatural beings such as ghosts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d398c78-0afc-38b0-93e5-359628d80e1a",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An affliction or disaster attributed to destiny, or to God."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "473193ef-608b-4339-9f46-a2ec7a2cfd44",
                                                "sense_id": "0d398c78-0afc-38b0-93e5-359628d80e1a",
                                                "text": "But when the blow comes down in the fulness of expectation; when the bough is smitten while green, and the flower cut down in its spring; when the young and lovely perish, while the eyes, full of light, were fixed on the future,—then, indeed, is the visitation heavy to bear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c97c4311-bb84-3313-a6ac-385101ec4546",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The right of a separated or divorced parent to visit a child; access."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1e6bdd3-76d8-3218-8bdc-f095f3a5892b",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A punishment or blessing ordained by God."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f45e1af8-2fbc-3a8b-9ba7-98843ae25481",
                                        "entry_id": "d0e033cf-560a-3337-aa54-79fe76b2bc88",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unusual and extensive irruption of a species of animals into another region."
                                        ],
